# Friends in one world: a friend comes in beside the player (a ring of each one's colour, the friend's name over
# them), walks off on their own and builds a road and a house; the player builds a house beside it; both go in;
# the friend leaves; then the start menu.
wait 10
guest on
wait 20
shot f01-joined
ghold DOWN 25
hold RIGHT 12
shot f02-apart
gkey X
gkey A
wait 20
gkey Y
ghold LEFT 6
gkey A
wait 20
shot f03-built
log
gkey X
gkey A
wait 10
shot f04-friend-inside
tp 9 67
hold UP+LEFT 2
key A
wait 10
shot f05-both-inside
ghold DOWN 12
hold RIGHT 10
shot f06-inside-moving
guest off
wait 10
shot f07-friend-left
net close
wait 10
shot f08-start
